<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">EAT MINDFULLY, MOVE JOYFULLY</view><view class="heading">好好吃饭，轻轻运动。</view><view class="notice section">食品营养与运动强度均为原型演示参数；份量和消耗是估算，不等同精确测量。</view><view class="segmented section"><button wx:for="{{tabs}}" wx:key="key" class="segment {{tab===item.key?'active':''}}" data-tab="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectTab">{{item.label}}</button></view><input class="input mt" placeholder="搜索食物、食谱或运动" value="{{query}}" bindinput="search"/><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="2000-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="date-control mt">记录到 {{date}} ⌄</view></picker><view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="card section empty">没有找到相关内容。</view><view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="card section"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><text class="caption">{{tab==='foods'?item.group:tab==='recipes'?item.time+'分钟':item.met+' MET · 演示强度'}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{tab!=='activities'}}" class="pill">{{item.kcal}} kcal / {{tab==='foods'?'100'+item.unit:'份'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.conflicts && item.conflicts.length}}" class="notice warn mt">与你设置的限制相关：{{item.conflictsText}}。请核对真实配料。</view><view wx:if="{{tab==='recipes'}}"><text class="caption mt">{{item.ingredientsText}}</text><view wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:key="*this" class="caption">{{index+1}}. {{item}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{tab!=='activities'}}" class="caption">蛋白质 {{item.protein}}g · 碳水 {{item.carb}}g · 脂肪 {{item.fat}}g</text><button class="btn soft small mt" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">{{activeId===item.id?'正在填写':'记到日记 ›'}}</button><view wx:if="{{activeId===item.id}}" class="mt"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">{{tab==='foods'?'份量 / '+item.unit:tab==='recipes'?'份数':'运动分钟'}}</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{amount}}" bindinput="amount"/></view><view wx:if="{{tab==='activities'}}" class="form-field"><text class="form-label">本次体重 / kg，用于消耗估算</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{weight}}" bindinput="weight"/></view><picker wx:else range="{{slots}}" value="{{slot}}" bindchange="slot"><view class="picker">{{slots[slot]}} ⌄</view></picker><button class="btn mt" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存记录</button></view></view></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
